    "flatRoof": "a9a72df3 replaces generic industrial chimney with current source brick shaft/cap/flue. Old flat-roof assertion used generic\u2212.12m/+1.169m instead of actual source\u22121/V and +40.3/V. Domestic and chapel assertions remain exact.",
