    "porch": "cdff49d9 replaces the generic sign with the current source board/strokes/timber bracket joined to the already raised native porch. Old arbitrarymin1.9m conflicts with the accepted board at1.55m. New check reads actual source rect, preserves its relative board height, requires actual bracket\u2192beam surface contact and all sign faces inside intact support cells. Opposite sprite views omit the sign glyph; source proportions are read once from the front-visible source and retained acrossrotations."
  },
  "independentInvariants": [
    "Forge flat-roof masonry and cap/flue use actual current ArchitectureVolume source bottom/top/palette/texture, with source roofRise removed; no generated pitched rise.",
